mp's so-called  election defense fund  investigators testified the fund didn't  exist and that some of the money went to  trump's hotel collection and the event  company that organized the january 6  rally not only was there the big lie  there was the big ripoff  the committee plans another half dozen  public hearings to connect the election  lies with the violence of january 6.  they say evidence will show that trump  tried to corrupt the justice department  and when that failed assembled the mob  that would try to keep him in power by  force heidi jo castro al jazeera  washington
 

